{"version":1,"content":"<p>踏入秋天，台灣武陵農場的銀杏開始轉黃。</p><p>武陵農場facebook今（17日）發文表示：「早晨的陽光，讓銀杏更顯黃」。</p><p>從帖文相片可見，銀杏開始由綠轉黃。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T06:59:02.751303+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":76,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T06:00:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T08:37:34.560187+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T06:57:35.465964+00:00","content_hash":"380447147e13aa0fd49595bd380913cf2e5f9a2337bbfb1526f2a87ec6a2a804","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}